From e4cb7af19d42ebed4a4a414738be1a1fd22fe0a0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 11:37:36 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan_memexport_compute_hoist: run memexport-only vertex
 draws (GPU particle updates) as compute dispatches replayed at the render
 pass hoist point instead of splitting the pass; memexport compute translation
 skips the position output

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JJM25S15YdvewrFFwP8g6Z
---
